        "snippet": "Chinese scientists achieve breakthrough in quantum error correction\n\\_Guangming Online\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n![GMW.CN](//img.gmw.cn/images/51909.files/img/logo_gmw_bak.png)\n\n[Home](https://en.gmw.cn)\n[Guangming Insights](//en.gmw.cn/node_140149.htm)\n[China](//en.gmw.cn/node_23668.htm)\n[World](//en.gmw.cn/node_32068.htm)\n[Culture](//en.gmw.cn/node_23654.htm)\n[Nature](//en.gmw.cn/node_60876.htm)\n[Life](//en.gmw.cn/node_32066.htm)\n[Sci & Tech](//en.gmw.cn/node_60874.htm)\n[Infographic](//en.gmw.cn/node_140148.htm)\n[Video](//en.gmw.cn/node_86648.htm)",
