        "markdown": "Quantum Error Correction - IBM Research\n\n[View all topics](/topics)\n\nQuantum Error Correction\n========================\n\nIBM Quantum has a clear roadmap to practical quantum advantage in the coming years. This goal requires scalable, error-corrected quantum systems. We develop bottom-up approaches to the problem of noisy qubits and incorporate error correction techniques to realize this technology’s true potential.\n\nOur work\n--------\n\n* ### [A glimpse at computing’s quantum-centric future](/blog/accelerating-qpus-with-gpus)\n\n  Explainer\n\n  Ryan Mandelbaum and Jerry Chow\n\n  29 Jan 2026\n\n  + [Hybrid Cloud HPC](/topics/hybrid-cloud-hpc)\n  + [Quantum](/quantum-computing)\n  + [Quantum Algorithms](/quantum-computing)\n  + [Quantum Error Correction & Mitigation](/topics/quantum-error-correction)\n  + [Quantum Research](/topics/quantum-information-science)\n* ### [Scaling for quantum advantage and beyond](/blog/qdc-2025)\n\n  ![](data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7)![](https://research.ibm.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fresearch-website-prod-cms-uploads.s3.us.cloud-object-storage.appdomain.cloud%2FIBM_Quantum_Nighthawk_Held_6_c729a18ff2.jpg&w=3840&q=75)\n\n  News\n\n  Ryan Mandelbaum\n\n  12 Nov 2025\n\n  + [Qiskit](/quantum-computing)\n  + [Quantum Algorithms](/quantum-computing)\n  + [Quantum Community](/topics/quantum-community)\n  + [Quantum Error Correction & Mitigation](/topics/quantum-error-correction)\n  + [Quantum Network](/quantum-computing)\n  + [Quantum Software](/topics/quantum-circuits-and-software)\n  + [Quantum Systems](/topics/quantum-hardware)\n* ### [Relay-BP: The world’s fastest, most accurate decoder for qLDPC error correction codes](/blog/relay-bp-error-correction-decoder)\n\n  ![](data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7)![](https://research.ibm.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fresearch-website-prod-cms-uploads.s3.us.cloud-obj