\n  + [Quantum Systems](/topics/quantum-hardware)\n* [See more of our work on Quantum Error Correction](/blog?tag=quantum-error-correction)\n\nPublications\n------------\n\n* ### [AlphaSyndrome: Tackling the Syndrome Measurement Circuit Scheduling Problem for QEC Codes](/publications/alphasyndrome-tackling-the-syndrome-measurement-circuit-scheduling-problem-for-qec-codes)\n\n  + - Yuhao Liu\n    - Shuohao Ping\n    - et al.\n  + 2026\n  + ASPLOS 2026\n\n  Conference paper\n* ### [Improved belief propagation is sufficient for real-time decoding of quantum memory](/publications/improved-belief-propagation-is-sufficient-for-real-time-decoding-of-quantum-memory)\n\n  + - Tristan Müller\n    - Thomas Alexander\n    - et al.\n  + 2026\n  + APS Global Physics Summit 2026\n\n  Talk\n* ### [Classically propagating noise for faster error mitigation](/publications/classically-propagating-noise-for-faster-error-mitigation)\n\n  + - Andrew Eddins\n    - Caleb Johnson\n    - et al.\n  + 2026\n  + APS Global Physics Summit 2026\n\n  Talk\n* ### [Fail fast: techniques to probe rare events in quantum error correction](/publications/fail-fast-techniques-to-probe-rare-events-in-quantum-error-correction)\n\n  + - Michael Beverland\n    - Theodore Yoder\n    - et al.\n  + 2026\n  + APS Global Physics Summit 2026\n\n  Invited talk\n* ### [Theory of quantum error mitigation for non-Clifford gates](/publications/theory-of-quantum-error-mitigation-for-non-clifford-gates)\n\n  + - David Layden\n    - Brad Mitchell\n    - et al.\n  + 2026\n  + Quantum\n\n  Paper\n* ### [Dynamical simulations of many-body quantum chaos on a quantum computer](/publications/dynamical-simulations-of-many-body-quantum-chaos-on-a-quantum-computer--1)\n\n  + - [Laurin Fischer](/people/laurin-fischer)\n    - Matea Leahy\n    - et al.\n  + 2026\n  + Nature Physics\n\n  Paper\n\n[View all publications](/publications?tag=quantum-error-correction)\n\nRelated topics\n--------------\n\n* [Quantum Chemistry](/topics/quantum